# Historical first-party source/notes are archived under history/spike000/logs.
# No generated stdout/javap text, runtime JSON, JARs or class dumps are whitelisted.
!/history/spike000/logs/
!/history/spike000/logs/*/
!/history/spike000/logs/*/*.java
!/history/spike000/logs/*/*.md

# Installer-generated launcher/state files are not current first-party inputs.
